{"seq":1,"slug":"distributed-graph-databases","title":"分布式图数据库：NebulaGraph 与 TigerGraph","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/graph-database-engineering/platforms/distributed-graph-databases","wordCount":1512,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"分布式图数据库-nebulagraph-与-tigergraph\">分布式图数据库：NebulaGraph 与 TigerGraph</h1><p>当单机图数据库无法满足数据量或吞吐量需求时，需要引入分布式图数据库。分布式图数据库面临的核心挑战是：<strong>图数据的分区方式决定了遍历性能</strong>。本文深入分析 NebulaGraph 和 TigerGraph 的架构设计与工程实践。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>边切割（Edge Cut）</td>\n<td>节点分配到分区，跨分区边产生幽灵边；适合均匀度分布图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>顶点切割（Vertex Cut）</td>\n<td>边分配到分区，超级节点在多分区有副本；适合幂律度分布图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NebulaGraph</td>\n<td>字节跳动开源的分布式原生图数据库，三服务架构（Graph/Meta/Storage）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TigerGraph</td>\n<td>商业图数据库，原生并行图引擎，深度图分析性能突出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>nGQL</td>\n<td>NebulaGraph 的查询语言，3.x 版本起兼容 openCypher</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GSQL</td>\n<td>TigerGraph 的图查询语言，类 SQL 语法结合图遍历原语</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VID（顶点 ID）</td>\n<td>NebulaGraph 要求显式指定的顶点标识符，直接决定数据分区位置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"图分区策略\">图分区策略</h2><p>分布式图数据库必须解决如何将图数据分散到多台机器的问题。主要有两种分区策略：</p>\n<h3 id=\"顶点切割-vertex-cut-vs-边切割-edge-cut\">顶点切割（Vertex Cut）vs 边切割（Edge Cut）</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph VC[顶点切割 Vertex Cut]&#10;        V1[&quot;分区1\\n节点A(副本)\\n节点B&quot;]&#10;        V2[&quot;分区2\\n节点A(主)\\n节点C&quot;]&#10;        V1 ---|共享 A| V2&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph EC[边切割 Edge Cut]&#10;        E1[&quot;分区1\\n节点A\\n节点B&quot;]&#10;        E2[&quot;分区2\\n节点C\\n节点D&quot;]&#10;        E1 -.-&gt;|跨分区边| E2&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph VC[顶点切割 Vertex Cut]\n        V1[\"分区1\\n节点A(副本)\\n节点B\"]\n        V2[\"分区2\\n节点A(主)\\n节点C\"]\n        V1 ---|共享 A| V2\n    end\n    subgraph EC[边切割 Edge Cut]\n        E1[\"分区1\\n节点A\\n节点B\"]\n        E2[\"分区2\\n节点C\\n节点D\"]\n        E1 -.-&gt;|跨分区边| E2\n    end</pre><p><strong>边切割（Edge Cut）</strong>：每个节点分配到一个分区，跨分区的边产生「幽灵边（ghost edge）」。节点数据不重复，但跨分区遍历需要网络请求。适合稀疏图（边数接近节点数），多数图数据库早期版本采用此策略。</p>\n<p><strong>顶点切割（Vertex Cut）</strong>：每条边分配到一个分区，高度节点在多个分区有副本，副本之间需要同步。适合幂律分布图（少量超节点连接大量低度节点），能降低跨分区通信。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>边切割</td>\n<td>节点数据唯一，一致性简单</td>\n<td>跨分区边增加通信</td>\n<td>均匀度分布图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>顶点切割</td>\n<td>减少跨分区通信</td>\n<td>节点副本同步开销</td>\n<td>幂律度分布图</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"nebulagraph\">NebulaGraph</h2><p>NebulaGraph 是字节跳动主导开源的分布式原生图数据库，在字节内部服务着万亿级边的超大规模图场景。</p>\n<h3 id=\"架构设计\">架构设计</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Client[客户端] --&gt; GS[Graph Service\\n查询语言层 nGQL]&#10;    GS --&gt; Meta[Meta Service\\n元数据管理\\n集群拓扑/Schema]&#10;    GS --&gt; Storage[Storage Service\\n分布式存储层 Raft]&#10;    Storage --&gt; StorageNode1[存储节点 1\\nRocksDB]&#10;    Storage --&gt; StorageNode2[存储节点 2\\nRocksDB]&#10;    Storage --&gt; StorageNode3[存储节点 3\\nRocksDB]&#10;    Meta --&gt; MetaNode1[Meta 节点 1]&#10;    Meta --&gt; MetaNode2[Meta 节点 2]&#10;    Meta --&gt; MetaNode3[Meta 节点 3]\">graph TD\n    Client[客户端] --&gt; GS[Graph Service\\n查询语言层 nGQL]\n    GS --&gt; Meta[Meta Service\\n元数据管理\\n集群拓扑/Schema]\n    GS --&gt; Storage[Storage Service\\n分布式存储层 Raft]\n    Storage --&gt; StorageNode1[存储节点 1\\nRocksDB]\n    Storage --&gt; StorageNode2[存储节点 2\\nRocksDB]\n    Storage --&gt; StorageNode3[存储节点 3\\nRocksDB]\n    Meta --&gt; MetaNode1[Meta 节点 1]\n    Meta --&gt; MetaNode2[Meta 节点 2]\n    Meta --&gt; MetaNode3[Meta 节点 3]</pre><p>三个独立服务可以分别水平扩展：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Graph Service</strong>：无状态查询层，负责 nGQL 解析和查询执行计划，可横向扩展处理更多并发连接</li>\n<li><strong>Meta Service</strong>：管理集群元数据（Schema、分区分配、用户权限），基于 Raft 协议保证一致性</li>\n<li><strong>Storage Service</strong>：基于 RocksDB 的持久化层，采用 Raft 协议实现多副本，支持水平扩展</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"ngql-查询语言\">nGQL 查询语言</h3><p>NebulaGraph 使用自有的 nGQL 查询语言，兼容部分 Cypher 语法（3.x+ 版本开始支持 openCypher）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 创建 Schema&#10;CREATE TAG Person(name string, age int);&#10;CREATE EDGE KNOWS(since date);&#10;&#10;-- 插入数据（Vertex 必须有显式的 VID）&#10;INSERT VERTEX Person(name, age) VALUES &quot;alice&quot;:(&quot;Alice&quot;, 30);&#10;INSERT VERTEX Person(name, age) VALUES &quot;bob&quot;:(&quot;Bob&quot;, 25);&#10;INSERT EDGE KNOWS(since) VALUES &quot;alice&quot;-&gt;&quot;bob&quot;:(date(&quot;2020-01-01&quot;));&#10;&#10;-- 基本查询（nGQL 风格）&#10;GO 1 TO 3 STEPS FROM &quot;alice&quot; OVER KNOWS&#10;WHERE $$.Person.age &gt; 20&#10;YIELD $$.Person.name AS friend_name, $$.Person.age AS age&#10;&#10;-- openCypher 风格（兼容模式）&#10;MATCH (alice:Person {name: &quot;Alice&quot;})-[:KNOWS*1..3]-&gt;(friend:Person)&#10;WHERE friend.age &gt; 20&#10;RETURN friend.name, friend.age\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 创建 Schema</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TAG Person(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> string, age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> EDGE KNOWS(since </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 插入数据（Vertex 必须有显式的 VID）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> VERTEX Person(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, age) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"alice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Alice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> VERTEX Person(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, age) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"bob\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Bob\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> EDGE KNOWS(since) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"alice\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bob\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2020-01-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 基本查询（nGQL 风格）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GO</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TO</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> STEPS </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"alice\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> KNOWS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $$.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Person</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">age</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">YIELD $$.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Person</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> friend_name, $$.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Person</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">age</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- openCypher 风格（兼容模式）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">MATCH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (alice:Person {</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Alice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[:KNOWS*1..3]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(friend:Person)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> friend</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">age</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">RETURN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> friend</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">friend</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">age</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"顶点-id-设计\">顶点 ID 设计</h3><p>NebulaGraph 要求显式指定<strong>顶点 ID（VID）</strong>，VID 直接决定数据分区（通过哈希取模）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 整数 VID（推荐，性能更好）&#10;CREATE SPACE social_network(vid_type=INT64, partition_num=10, replica_factor=3)&#10;&#10;-- 字符串 VID（业务 ID 友好，但哈希冲突概率稍高）&#10;CREATE SPACE social_network(vid_type=FIXED_STRING(64), partition_num=10, replica_factor=3)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 整数 VID（推荐，性能更好）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SPACE social_network(vid_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">INT64, partition_num</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, replica_factor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 字符串 VID（业务 ID 友好，但哈希冲突概率稍高）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SPACE social_network(vid_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">FIXED_STRING(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), partition_num</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, replica_factor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>VID 设计建议</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>优先使用整数业务 ID（如用户 ID、商品 ID）</li>\n<li>字符串 VID 适合 UUID 或复合业务键</li>\n<li>避免随机 UUID 作为 VID（虽然分布均匀，但失去业务可读性）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"分区与副本\">分区与副本</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 分区数量建议：集群存储节点数 × 5（经验值）&#10;-- 副本数量：生产环境 3 副本（容忍 1 节点故障）&#10;CREATE SPACE production_graph(&#10;  partition_num=30,&#10;  replica_factor=3,&#10;  vid_type=INT64&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分区数量建议：集群存储节点数 × 5（经验值）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 副本数量：生产环境 3 副本（容忍 1 节点故障）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SPACE production_graph(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  partition_num</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  replica_factor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  vid_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">INT64</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"性能特点\">性能特点</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>写入性能</strong>：得益于 RocksDB 的 LSM-Tree 写优化，写吞吐极高</li>\n<li><strong>读取延迟</strong>：P99 通常在毫秒级，适合 OLTP 场景</li>\n<li><strong>超大规模</strong>：字节跳动生产环境单集群支持万亿条边</li>\n<li><strong>图算法</strong>：内置图算法有限，复杂分析通常通过数据导出到专门的图分析系统处理</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"tigergraph\">TigerGraph</h2><p>TigerGraph 是商业图数据库，以<strong>高性能图分析</strong>著称，同时支持 OLTP 和 OLAP 混合负载。</p>\n<h3 id=\"架构特点\">架构特点</h3><p>TigerGraph 采用专有的原生并行图（Native Parallel Graph）存储引擎：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>原生图存储</strong>：数据按图的自然结构存储，无索引邻接</li>\n<li><strong>多线程并行遍历</strong>：利用多核 CPU 并行执行图遍历</li>\n<li><strong>深链接分析</strong>：针对深度图遍历（10 跳以上）进行了特别优化</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"gsql-查询语言\">GSQL 查询语言</h3><p>TigerGraph 使用 GSQL（Graph SQL）查询语言，语法类似 SQL 但针对图操作做了扩展：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 定义图 Schema&#10;CREATE VERTEX Person (PRIMARY_ID id STRING, name STRING, age INT)&#10;  WITH primary_id_as_attribute=&quot;true&quot;&#10;CREATE DIRECTED EDGE KNOWS (FROM Person, TO Person, since DATE)&#10;CREATE GRAPH SocialNetwork (Person, KNOWS)&#10;&#10;-- GSQL 查询（程序化图遍历）&#10;CREATE QUERY findFriendsOfFriends(VERTEX&lt;Person&gt; startPerson) FOR GRAPH SocialNetwork {&#10;    OrAccum&lt;BOOL&gt; @visited;&#10;    SetAccum&lt;VERTEX&lt;Person&gt;&gt; @@result;&#10;&#10;    Start = {startPerson};&#10;    -- 第一跳&#10;    Friends = SELECT f FROM Start:s-(KNOWS:e)-&gt;Person:f&#10;              WHERE f != startPerson&#10;              ACCUM f.@visited += TRUE;&#10;    -- 第二跳&#10;    FoF = SELECT f FROM Friends:s-(KNOWS:e)-&gt;Person:f&#10;          WHERE NOT f.@visited AND f != startPerson&#10;          ACCUM @@result += f;&#10;    PRINT @@result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 定义图 Schema</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> VERTEX Person (PRIMARY_ID id STRING, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> STRING, age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> primary_id_as_attribute</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DIRECTED EDGE KNOWS (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Person, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Person, since </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GRAPH SocialNetwork (Person, KNOWS)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- GSQL 查询（程序化图遍历）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> QUERY findFriendsOfFriends(VERTEX</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Person</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> startPerson) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FOR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GRAPH SocialNetwork {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    OrAccum</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">BOOL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> @visited;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    SetAccum</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">VERTEX</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Person</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> @@result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    Start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {startPerson};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    -- 第一跳</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Friends </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> Start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(KNOWS:e)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Person:f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">              WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> startPerson</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              ACCUM f.@visited </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TRUE;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    -- 第二跳</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    FoF </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Friends:s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(KNOWS:e)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Person:f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f.@visited </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> startPerson</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          ACCUM @@result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    PRINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> @@result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"tigergraph-vs-nebulagraph-对比\">TigerGraph vs NebulaGraph 对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>TigerGraph</th>\n<th>NebulaGraph</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>许可</td>\n<td>商业（有社区版）</td>\n<td>Apache 2.0 开源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询语言</td>\n<td>GSQL</td>\n<td>nGQL + openCypher</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>擅长场景</td>\n<td>深度图分析、实时 OLAP</td>\n<td>超大规模 OLTP、高并发写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图算法</td>\n<td>内置丰富算法库</td>\n<td>有限内置，依赖外部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运维复杂度</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>高（三服务独立运维）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型用户</td>\n<td>金融风控、电信</td>\n<td>字节、快手等互联网公司</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大规模</td>\n<td>10B+ 节点（声称）</td>\n<td>1T+ 边（字节生产验证）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"分布式图数据库的共性挑战\">分布式图数据库的共性挑战</h2><h3 id=\"跨分区事务\">跨分区事务</h3><p>跨分区的写事务需要分布式事务协议（如 2PC 或 Saga），显著增加延迟：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"本地事务：1-2ms&#10;跨分区事务：10-50ms（取决于分区数量和网络延迟）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>本地事务：1-2ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>跨分区事务：10-50ms（取决于分区数量和网络延迟）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>实践建议：<strong>设计 Schema 时尽量让频繁共同操作的节点落在同一分区</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分布式死锁\">分布式死锁</h3><p>图的并发修改在分布式环境下更容易产生死锁。解决方案：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>全局死锁检测</strong>：周期性检测等待图中的环路（成本高）</li>\n<li><strong>超时机制</strong>：事务持锁超过阈值自动回滚（最常见）</li>\n<li><strong>避免策略</strong>：统一锁获取顺序</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>分布式图数据库通过水平扩展解决了单机图数据库的容量上限，但引入了新的复杂性：分区策略影响遍历性能，跨分区事务增加延迟，分布式死锁需要专门处理。NebulaGraph 以其字节跳动万亿级边的生产验证和 Apache 2.0 开源协议，成为互联网公司的首选；TigerGraph 以商业支持和深度图分析能力，服务于金融风控和电信运营商场景。选择分布式图数据库前，应评估团队的 Kubernetes 运维能力和数据规模是否真正超过了单机上限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章其他文档\">本章其他文档</h2><ul>\n<li>图数据库即服务：AWS Neptune、Azure Cosmos DB 等云托管方案</li>\n<li>图数据库对比与选型：全面的多平台决策矩阵</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分布式图数据库：NebulaGraph 与 TigerGraph","id":"分布式图数据库-nebulagraph-与-tigergraph"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"图分区策略","id":"图分区策略"},{"level":3,"text":"顶点切割（Vertex Cut）vs 边切割（Edge Cut）","id":"顶点切割-vertex-cut-vs-边切割-edge-cut"},{"level":2,"text":"NebulaGraph","id":"nebulagraph"},{"level":3,"text":"架构设计","id":"架构设计"},{"level":3,"text":"nGQL 查询语言","id":"ngql-查询语言"},{"level":3,"text":"顶点 ID 设计","id":"顶点-id-设计"},{"level":3,"text":"分区与副本","id":"分区与副本"},{"level":3,"text":"性能特点","id":"性能特点"},{"level":2,"text":"TigerGraph","id":"tigergraph"},{"level":3,"text":"架构特点","id":"架构特点"},{"level":3,"text":"GSQL 查询语言","id":"gsql-查询语言"},{"level":3,"text":"TigerGraph vs NebulaGraph 对比","id":"tigergraph-vs-nebulagraph-对比"},{"level":2,"text":"分布式图数据库的共性挑战","id":"分布式图数据库的共性挑战"},{"level":3,"text":"跨分区事务","id":"跨分区事务"},{"level":3,"text":"分布式死锁","id":"分布式死锁"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"本章其他文档","id":"本章其他文档"}],"prev":{"title":"Neo4j 工程实践：Bolt、APOC 与 GDS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/graph-database-engineering/engineering/neo4j-engineering"},"next":{"title":"图数据库即服务：Neptune、Cosmos DB 与 AuraDB","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/graph-database-engineering/platforms/graph-database-as-a-service"}}